{"title":"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_23\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 23</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Fast_-_Good_for_use_in_contest)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Fast - Good for use in contest)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_23\">Problem 23</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 23\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8acdb05cb79a9c8717989c53e35bca752636986a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a_k\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> be a sequence of integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b02a491e6fc8db3a577b344b1a53b7a8e77e0f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15769baac51bc344bdaec7747e04fce9324dfa50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"14\" /> for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd923e41635af40a1abe58f230732f2280b0723a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6bfb1f0a208187bed5a389462b7e45bb2a04c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8baf91f5ebb7dde68943923e36e20d09eb10a4fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 45\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 56\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 67\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 78\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 89$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4b5800f5ad040d308609190ef18a9e0ca08a9b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/4/e449dd3606058a687318b3a27773a91ce86791b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1}=1+a_n+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />. Hence,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aef06417bf8b8b89391fea61e1cb98eb7a215eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{2}=1+a_1+1\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d72d1eaefc94ae603d8e632b918684a866018c0d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{3}=1+a_2+2\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c9295690bdd597f32271e5fc8ad8a8c475d8d1d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{4}=1+a_3+3\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/16762e47f22f53e2431935f211fa82570b46b6cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dots\\]\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a0b1067f595a8c0e8a661368a8ca69a9a568797.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{12}=1+a_{11}+11\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"15\" />\nAdding these equations up, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd306deb8cf8ddbe260af7cb5f81b2d06ecefb14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{12}=12+(1+2+3+...+11)=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D) \\ } 78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"339\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>~AopsUser101\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbc309386e742de35e26e2f0b9fc4173a29818ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b2ed054f50dbe1d17fe8ab7a08ee7bb7ddcd14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m+1}=a_m+a_{1}+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b1171ce641826e9aca894162f9c15a57f6b46e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/5/7253ecfe2492dbc6e97e6193ef3e63846a8f7a3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m+1}=a_m+m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d766ad9195de7b651f011dc4f4256b98ff40b05c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m = a_{m-1} + m, a_{m-1}=a_{m-2}+(m-1), a_{m-2} = a_{m-3} + (m-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"511\" height=\"18\" />, and so on until <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd59b3f412ed32a236ae6309debc627eb12a4b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = a_1 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Adding the Left Hand Sides of all of these equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/a/64a4a425e895d1635544785759a5bf25d820d422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m + a_{m-1} + a_{m-2} + a_{m-3} + \\cdots + a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"287\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Adding the Right Hand Sides of these equations gives \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c744367d85b994b05a809b1ec72105d841ebf7f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_{m-1} + a_{m-2} + a_{m-3} + \\cdots + a_1) + (m + (m-1) + (m-2) + \\cdots + 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"551\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>These two expressions must be equal; hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cfca5939dad94e737b3ac4e3c2af81eab8daf3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m + a_{m-1} + a_{m-2} + a_{m-3} + \\cdots + a_2 = (a_{m-1} + a_{m-2} + a_{m-3} + \\cdots + a_1) + (m + (m-1) + (m-2) + \\cdots + 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"865\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/b/7dbfbbbd0376cd1b7a3489c2f351b6f6d33ba3b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m = a_1 + (m + (m-1) + (m-2) + \\cdots + 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"356\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b1171ce641826e9aca894162f9c15a57f6b46e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/5230553cd9f1c72e9e6f3b38df9d9d392d7b3abd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m = 1 + (m + (m-1) + (m-2) + \\cdots + 2) = 1+2+3+4+ \\cdots +m = \\frac{(m+1)(m)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"677\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Thus we have a general formula for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1ddf57a1507686a49e3d290b3542ccac565cd35a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"21\" height=\"10\" /> and substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dda80bd4f83db6b8ae1515c299c98ac3083af6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/b/60b678c17218eb0bd5f3898cf6b8fa59b1ce2a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{12} = \\frac{(13)(12)}{2} = (13)(6) = \\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)} 78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"278\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can literally just plug stuff in. No prerequisite is actually said in the sequence. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/e/cde770f7c812419bc0a32b4572634e29865ec566.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m+n} = a_m+a_n +mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"14\" />, we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/9/319b4414063907afa05ae8f662b945bb7e2ef505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=a_1+a_1+1\\cdot1=1+1+1=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"280\" height=\"15\" />. After this, we can use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e28850813a5321d2a8ae3c0510457a7337975ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8035207607946e30a4d7cc3734f8e4ce22cc70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4=a_2+a_2+2\\cdot 2 = 3+3+4 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"289\" height=\"15\" />. Now, we can use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e28850813a5321d2a8ae3c0510457a7337975ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34ace040475607683853fcfd4960a8f7fa6678c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/d/d6d62456e99eced58dd57ac88429cfd5eea50392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6=a_4+a_2+4\\cdot 2 = 10+3+8=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"297\" height=\"15\" />. Lastly, we can use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34ace040475607683853fcfd4960a8f7fa6678c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6bfb1f0a208187bed5a389462b7e45bb2a04c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/a/a4af4158c138378329bbd52201d0c3d012fe5981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{12} = a_6+a_6+6\\cdot 6 = 21+21+36= \\boxed{\\mathrm{(D) \\ } 78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"370\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, so we can say that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e11a0c3d648fe89dc2008c29e4b9dba61e4986.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{m + m} = a_m + a_m + m*m\\]\" width=\"205\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f04f705a62096b5dbefa309be248f9cbbaa8df5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{2m} = 2a_m + m^2\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae63293e58ad0185f715021c4ff800a48a50e2bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2m = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970c67d43e2cd7f3e62f1e9afeb5d18508c8dd34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 6$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/9/9491d260f1aeaafa41b3d0918bfb8c46a2a93e5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{12} = 2a_6 + 36\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/c/64cac487d22555cff8b098157426db871f16a571.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2m = 6$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />m, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27b00129906b721ebe808a705e83d5df749a4ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 3$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/7/b2744b22d14521cdb0e49a869119d46e7ad980ee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_6 = 2a_3 + 9\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/572b65ebc3f438b176b4ca4a890799f2f72564af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> is easy, just direct substitution.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/5/3555dd02a3ab15fa5b5df91c8bd1e51015353b40.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_2 = 1 + 1 + 1 = 3\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/f/57faffab5e14d760fd35858286d6167e4b5866d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_3 = a_{2 + 1} = 3 + 1 + 2 = 6\\]\" width=\"203\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Substituting, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d4bfa17bdbbea6f8a5f536ea0448b78fe1bbac8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_6 = 2(6) + 9 = 21\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/8/1f8fdfa7efb5a5f72709a05d3755226952b7f8ec.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{12} = 2(21) + 36 = 78\\]\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~ euler123\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the sequence of triangular numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/1/d0135d49ccd2c383d1ac1b4e5e19cf6af3cab32c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_n=1+2+3+...+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"185\" height=\"15\" /> satisfies these conditions. It is immediately obvious that it satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b02a491e6fc8db3a577b344b1a53b7a8e77e0f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbc309386e742de35e26e2f0b9fc4173a29818ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m+n}=a_m+a_n+mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" /> can be visually proven with the diagram below.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/f/35fd346c6b8de4b5d49b16a163d49e70861d5e2f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] for(int i=5; i &gt; 0; --i) { for(int j=0; j &lt; i; ++j) { draw(circle((j+(5-i)/2,(5-i)*sqrt(3)/2),.2)); }; }; path m1 = brace((2,-.3),(0,-.3),.2); draw(m1); label(&quot;$m$&quot;,m1,S);  path n1 = brace((4,-.3),(3,-.3),.2); draw(n1); label(&quot;$n$&quot;,n1,S);   draw((-.2*sqrt(3),-.2)--(2+.2*sqrt(3),-.2)--(1,.4+sqrt(3))--cycle); label(&quot;$T_m$&quot;,(1,1/3*sqrt(3)));  draw((3-.2*sqrt(3),-.2)--(4+.2*sqrt(3),-.2)--(3.5,.4+.5*sqrt(3))--cycle); label(&quot;$T_n$&quot;,(3.5,.5/3*sqrt(3)));   path m2 = brace((2+.15*sqrt(3),.15+2*sqrt(3)),(3+.15*sqrt(3),.15+sqrt(3)),.2); draw(m2); label(&quot;$m$&quot;,m2,(.5*sqrt(3),.5));  path n2 = brace((1.5-.15*sqrt(3),.15+1.5*sqrt(3)),(2-.15*sqrt(3),.15+2*sqrt(3)),.2); draw(n2); label(&quot;$n$&quot;,n2,(-.5*sqrt(3),.5));   draw((2.5,-.4+.5*sqrt(3))--(3+.4/3*sqrt(3),sqrt(3))--(2,.4+2*sqrt(3))--(1.5-.4/3*sqrt(3),1.5*sqrt(3))--cycle); label(&quot;$mn$&quot;,(2.25,1.25*sqrt(3))); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>This means that we can use the triangular number formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/c/c3c2697932cf8fa792ed50ee3b430726a8d8097a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/c/09c8a03b45eef10e256fd6a3b094cdc441c493e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_{12} = \\frac{12(12+1)}{2} = \\boxed{\\mathrm{(D) \\ } 78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"222\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Emerald_block\" title=\"User:Emerald block\">emerald_block</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Follow solution 4 with plugging in m=n, but for the last part since since the subscript is 2n, and we aren't given anything that has odd numbers ( without substitution into the original equation), we need to find two numbers that add up to 12, which result from the multiplication of two even numbers. We realize that 4+8 works, since 4=2x2 and 8=4x2. We then proceed in substituting n=2 and n=4 into the equation, then add to obtain 78.\n~Charmainema07292010\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Fast_-_Good_for_use_in_contest.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Fast_-_Good_for_use_in_contest)\">Solution 6 (Fast - Good for use in contest)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Fast - Good for use in contest)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> which is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38a14721007a87ef4da292e325ee66b924ad2008.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_2 = a_{1+1} = 1+1+1 = 3\\]\" width=\"203\" height=\"16\" />. Now, we can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e28850813a5321d2a8ae3c0510457a7337975ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> and so on until <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6bfb1f0a208187bed5a389462b7e45bb2a04c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" />. So here goes: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a91948c7b494f66d856c0d30b25389dcc0c62957.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_4 = a_{2+2} = 3+3+4 = 10\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad82941b2c7551623a1dec7e14ffd7e45e5eef98.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_8 = a_{4+4} = 10+10+16 = 36\\]\" width=\"239\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d597a41552fa03702cb22a2a955f0b30afaf2d0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{12} = a_{8+4} = 36+10+32 = \\boxed{\\mathrm{(D) \\ } 78}\\]\" width=\"292\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-jb2015007\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zraGzYAh0uM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zraGzYAh0uM</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B\">2002 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Proble